WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Holding you and kissing you enough to bask in

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Fighting and loving each other enough to bask in

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
I want to know you, just as you are

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
But I'm the one who can't just be myself

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
I don't understand

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Your heart

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
Why is it?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Are you really a sorceress then?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
I want to hold you

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Alone, I cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
I don't ever want to be alone again

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
I want to hold you

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
With you, I fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
I melt into the emotional voice
that almost seems to be crying

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:01:33.727 --> 00:01:35.228
Well...

00:01:38.632 --> 00:01:41.335
His face is like this, and...

00:01:44.738 --> 00:01:47.841
His forelegs are like this.

00:01:51.378 --> 00:01:54.581
His wings are like this.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.518
Okay, all done!

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:03.023
Orphen, this is...

00:02:03.023 --> 00:02:05.792
There's no doubt. It's Bloody August.

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:12.566
How about it? Ain't I good?

00:02:12.566 --> 00:02:15.068
When I grow up, I'm gonna be a picture drawer!

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:18.639
When you get famous,
give me your signature, okay?

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.975
Little boy, it's tugging!

00:02:22.409 --> 00:02:23.844
Oh, no!

00:02:27.948 --> 00:02:29.750
Azalie's at the river's source?

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.619
Towards Gineruba Mountain.

00:02:32.786 --> 00:02:34.621
What are you going to do, Orphen?

00:02:39.593 --> 00:02:41.061
It's already decided.

00:02:42.696 --> 00:02:48.702
€ach and every thought

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:59.012
| see. Lai doesn't know how to handle
the detection of Bloody August?

00:02:59.713 --> 00:03:05.419
As soon as it is detected,
we shall mount the final offensive.

00:03:05.986 --> 00:03:08.221
Understood, Childman?

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:13.160
| am often grateful to you, Elders,
that you have not shunned me.

00:03:14.695 --> 00:03:20.167
You have not only not punished me,
but have given me the honor of their disposal.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.470
I, who has had two traitors
from among my students.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.238
| do not possess words enough to thank you.

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:30.310
| shall place the honor of
the Tower of Fangs upon it

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:33.046
and shall annihilate Azalie,

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:37.651
even should it require the cost of my own life,
and thus shall I repay you.

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.021
An admirable attitude.

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:44.691
We shall expect much, Childman.

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:46.393
Yes!

00:03:50.831 --> 00:03:53.233
He has changed much.

00:03:53.967 --> 00:04:00.941
At this rate, it shall not be long before we witness
the birth of the youngest Elder in history.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.224
If you wag your tail just a little,
this is what you get.

00:04:17.524 --> 00:04:20.894
It's not hard to seduce the Elders.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:31.972
| cannot help but think there is
something behind Childman's change.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:36.309
At this rate, the Tower of Fangs
will someday be his.

00:04:36.777 --> 00:04:38.178
You do understand?

00:04:38.178 --> 00:04:42.816
Yes, I shall kill Bloody August
with my own hands,

00:04:42.816 --> 00:04:46.453
or find out what Childman's hiding.

00:04:47.154 --> 00:04:49.756
I'm counting on you, Flameheart.

00:04:49.756 --> 00:04:53.660
The entire Tower of Fangs
shall become ours, as mother and son.

00:04:54.027 --> 00:04:56.963
| understand, Mother.

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:10.043
Wow!

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:13.446
It's so beautiful, like a forest from a fairy tale!

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:17.584
It's fine to play a cultured person, but...

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:22.122
Say, Orphen, what do you plan to do
when you meet Bloody August?

00:05:24.191 --> 00:05:27.127
We still haven't found the way to turn her back.

00:05:27.127 --> 00:05:29.429
There's no use in seeing her right now.

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:31.865
It's just dangerous. There's no use, no use.

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:34.701
Don't trouble me with righteous reasoning.

00:05:35.936 --> 00:05:38.872
There's no reason to it. I want to see her.

00:05:40.207 --> 00:05:41.508
That's all.

00:05:41.508 --> 00:05:45.512
Hey, Orphen, my late father used to say this,

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:49.749
"Love is blind, so think hard before you propose."

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:51.418
What wise words!

00:05:51.418 --> 00:05:55.822
When I see Bloody August,
I'll think hard before I propose!

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:57.591
So, that's your comeback?

00:05:58.058 --> 00:06:00.660
| don't know, but this isn't fun!

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.700
Master's changed, hasn't he?

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.972
Before, when he thought about Miss Azalie,
he was so scary that I couldn't go near him.

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:16.009
| wonder what could have possibly changed him?

00:06:16.643 --> 00:06:17.811
You don't know?

00:06:18.245 --> 00:06:20.146
What? Me?

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:21.882
It wasn't me!

00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:23.650
| didn't swipe any breakfast!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.785
There's just no accounting for taste.

00:06:27.587 --> 00:06:29.322
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:29.322 --> 00:06:31.825
If you don't get a move on,
the sun will go down!

00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:33.493
Yes!

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:08.929
Krylancelo?

00:07:09.195 --> 00:07:13.033
Yes, I was wondering when
you could meet Krylancelo.

00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:14.067
Meet?

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:16.036
There is no need to meet him.

00:07:17.304 --> 00:07:20.006
What do you plan to do with him, Master?

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:21.808
There's nothing to do about it.

00:07:21.808 --> 00:07:25.245
If he should choose to bother me,
then at that time...

00:07:25.245 --> 00:07:26.446
But then...

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:27.447
Hartia!

00:07:28.515 --> 00:07:31.418
| understand your feelings for your old friend,

00:07:31.418 --> 00:07:35.088
but I do not want a third traitor
from among my students.

00:07:35.088 --> 00:07:36.656
Watch what you say.

00:07:41.962 --> 00:07:43.196
Bloody August!

00:07:44.631 --> 00:07:46.099
| will accompany you.

00:07:46.099 --> 00:07:49.336
There's no need for that.
| alone am sufficient.

00:07:52.672 --> 00:07:53.740
Master...

00:07:54.841 --> 00:07:56.376
You are forgetting this.

00:07:58.812 --> 00:08:00.747
Sorry, I'll be back.

00:08:15.362 --> 00:08:17.697
A sortie, Childman?

00:08:19.065 --> 00:08:21.301
Please be very careful.

00:08:21.301 --> 00:08:23.803
Should you hold back because
he was once your student,

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:25.438
then you shall meet a painful fate.

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:28.908
You are far too kind-hearted.

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:32.012
Do you remember the practice bout
from eight years ago?

00:08:32.412 --> 00:08:34.180
At the time,

00:08:35.315 --> 00:08:39.819
you, to save a single butterfly
that wandered in,

00:08:39.819 --> 00:08:45.525
mistimed your magic
and had to take my assault.

00:08:47.394 --> 00:08:50.163
Far more than a butterfly,

00:08:50.163 --> 00:08:52.532
your opponent, the former teacher's pet...

00:08:52.999 --> 00:08:55.402
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:08:56.136 --> 00:08:58.872
No, there was something like that...

00:08:59.172 --> 00:09:01.007
I'm in a hurry. Excuse me.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.278
To Gineruba Mountain.

00:09:14.888 --> 00:09:17.891
What are you thinking, Childman?

00:09:25.398 --> 00:09:26.633
Why is it?

00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:29.669
Why is it that Master won't see Krylancelo?

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:34.140
He promised to see him
and tell him everything!

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.878
So now...

00:09:47.754 --> 00:09:48.688
I will!

00:10:11.678 --> 00:10:16.382
Say, Orphen. If we've searched
this much and she's not here,

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:19.319
doesn't that mean Bloody August isn't here?

00:10:19.319 --> 00:10:20.386
Not done yet.

00:10:20.386 --> 00:10:22.522
It's not like we've searched
the entire mountain yet.

00:10:22.755 --> 00:10:24.757
That's true, but...

00:10:24.757 --> 00:10:28.261
It just doesn't seem like a
Bloody August type of place.

00:10:28.261 --> 00:10:30.330
| think so too.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:31.831
See? See?

00:10:31.831 --> 00:10:34.334
Number one, the forest is too peaceful.

00:10:34.334 --> 00:10:35.502
True, true.

00:10:35.502 --> 00:10:40.373
If Bloody August was here,
we'd certainly feel that weird evilness.

00:10:40.373 --> 00:10:41.608
True, true.

00:10:41.941 --> 00:10:44.110
| get it. Let's rest a little while.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.778
Leki, what's wrong?

00:10:58.758 --> 00:11:00.293
Wait a minute!

00:11:05.999 --> 00:11:07.667
Bloody August...

00:11:11.571 --> 00:11:13.907
What a peaceful atmosphere this is.

00:11:17.177 --> 00:11:19.312
What a gentle sleeping expression.

00:11:19.312 --> 00:11:20.446
It seems like a lie.

00:11:26.119 --> 00:11:27.120
Azalie...

00:11:49.042 --> 00:11:51.678
She's sleeping so peacefully.

00:11:54.247 --> 00:11:58.785
Azalie, even you have a place
where you can sleep peacefully.

00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:02.388
When I thought that you may have
been wounded, tired,

00:12:02.388 --> 00:12:06.859
your body and soul torn to shreds,
| couldn't sleep nights.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.062
I'm relieved.

00:12:09.462 --> 00:12:12.565
I'm relieved. Now I can do what I have to do.

00:12:12.899 --> 00:12:17.003
Azalie, I will return you to your former state!

00:12:17.303 --> 00:12:21.040
Please wait a while longer
while I find out how to do that.

00:12:22.909 --> 00:12:24.110
Azalie...

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:27.080
Orphen, you're just a little relieved, aren't you?

00:12:28.648 --> 00:12:31.818
There's someone else
sleeping peacefully over there.

00:12:32.385 --> 00:12:34.287
Volcan! Dortin!

00:12:34.587 --> 00:12:36.489
So this is the rare culinary treat,

00:12:36.489 --> 00:12:40.493
the Gineruba truffle called
the Treasure of Gineruba Mountain,

00:12:40.493 --> 00:12:43.496
finally, at my table.

00:12:44.864 --> 00:12:49.269
Big Brother, that's the poo from
that rabbit we saw earlier.

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:53.506
What are they doing here?

00:12:56.142 --> 00:12:57.243
We're going!

00:12:57.644 --> 00:12:59.979
You're going, just like that?

00:12:59.979 --> 00:13:03.049
Yeah, I want to let her sleep peacefully.

00:13:03.416 --> 00:13:06.519
And there's still nothing I can do right now.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.688
Right, Cleao?

00:13:09.789 --> 00:13:11.658
It's good we came, right, Orphen?

00:13:11.658 --> 00:13:12.692
Yeah...

00:13:29.042 --> 00:13:33.346
Azalie, some day I will save you.

00:13:33.713 --> 00:13:36.482
Until then wait with a peaceful soul.

00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:41.621
This sickle is!

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:55.601
So you popped up, Shrimp Man!

00:13:56.769 --> 00:13:58.471
How many times do I have to
tell you before you understand?

00:13:58.471 --> 00:14:00.073
I am not Shrimp Man!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:08.014
Listen, I am the assassin
who lives in the night.

00:14:08.448 --> 00:14:12.685
| have a covenant with the night
and by day, I live hiding my face.

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:15.021
| am the embodiment of fear and evil!

00:14:15.021 --> 00:14:17.857
Of the House of Demonic Dreams, my name is...

00:14:18.424 --> 00:14:19.826
Black Tiger!

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:25.264
| got to say my name smoothly this time!
The future looks good!

00:14:25.264 --> 00:14:26.799
No!

00:14:26.999 --> 00:14:29.001
Stop it!

00:14:29.335 --> 00:14:31.404
What should I do?!

00:14:32.004 --> 00:14:36.376
Oh, no! He saw a round rock,
and unthinkingly his dung beetle instincts...

00:14:36.376 --> 00:14:37.243
Stop!

00:14:37.243 --> 00:14:38.745
Stop that, Concetta!

00:14:44.317 --> 00:14:45.451
Cleao!

00:14:45.451 --> 00:14:46.486
You!

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:50.523
To be after me is bad enough,
but Cleao too?

00:14:50.523 --> 00:14:52.458
Are these Childman's orders too?

00:14:52.825 --> 00:14:55.428
You're wrong! This is...
This is an unfortunate accident!

00:14:55.428 --> 00:14:56.763
A big misunderstanding!

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:10.510
Th-that's why it's a misunderstanding, like I said.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.146
It's just Concetta's cute instincts and...

00:15:13.146 --> 00:15:14.881
Don't spew those excuses from your mouth!

00:15:16.849 --> 00:15:20.286
There's no helping it.
| didn't want to use this method, but...

00:15:31.898 --> 00:15:34.267
As a proof of my innocence,

00:15:34.267 --> 00:15:37.203
| shall give you what is second
in importance only to my life,

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.273
my Black Tiger mangal!

00:15:43.843 --> 00:15:46.746
To let this go is more painful
than having my limbs cut off.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.348
Farewell, beloved reading!

00:15:49.348 --> 00:15:51.751
Farewell, days of my youth!

00:15:54.954 --> 00:15:56.456
Master...

00:15:56.956 --> 00:15:59.759
Cleao's okay! It's just a scratch.

00:15:59.959 --> 00:16:02.295
What did you do, you?!

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:05.431
Apologize now, you idiot!

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:20.179
Well, what business do you have with me?

00:16:20.179 --> 00:16:23.483
Orphen, there's no reason for you
to talk with this guy.

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:25.918
It's okay, Cleao.

00:16:25.918 --> 00:16:27.687
What is it? What's your business?

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:31.491
| would like you to listen with a calm soul.

00:16:32.225 --> 00:16:35.461
You misunderstand the man called Childman.

00:16:36.562 --> 00:16:38.865
"A murderer who unconcernedly
tries to kill his students

00:16:38.865 --> 00:16:41.968
for the sake of the honor of
the Tower of Fangs,"

00:16:42.268 --> 00:16:43.936
but that's a misunderstanding.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:47.540
You came all this way just to say that garbage?

00:16:48.808 --> 00:16:51.410
Listen, Orphen, to the truth!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:53.212
To Childman's true feelings!

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:58.851
Childman knows the way to
return Azalie to her former self.

00:16:58.851 --> 00:17:01.954
He's worked hard for that end!

00:17:02.955 --> 00:17:04.657
Wh-what did you say?

00:17:08.261 --> 00:17:12.965
You think I'd believe a lie like that?

00:17:13.266 --> 00:17:15.601
I've seen him try to kill Azalie many times.

00:17:16.002 --> 00:17:18.671
That is to lead the Tower of Fangs astray.

00:17:18.671 --> 00:17:22.275
Even should her physical self be destroyed,
as long as you have her heart,

00:17:22.275 --> 00:17:25.044
then someday it will be possible
to regenerate Azalie.

00:17:25.244 --> 00:17:27.647
As long as you have her heart?!

00:17:27.647 --> 00:17:29.248
That's a lie!

00:17:30.416 --> 00:17:34.120
If that's true, then why didn't he tell me?!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.423
That is because he didn't want you to die.

00:17:38.624 --> 00:17:41.027
That magic is not ordinary magic.

00:17:41.394 --> 00:17:43.062
With your current strength,

00:17:43.062 --> 00:17:46.666
if you tried to save Azalie,
your own life would be uncertain.

00:17:46.666 --> 00:17:51.170
So Master, no, Childman has
kept it hidden from you,

00:17:51.837 --> 00:17:54.240
no matter how much you hated him.

00:17:54.607 --> 00:17:56.442
As if you'd heard him!

00:17:56.442 --> 00:17:59.745
You think I'll believe a made-up story like that?

00:18:00.046 --> 00:18:03.049
The loneliness and suffering
of these past five years...

00:18:03.049 --> 00:18:05.618
| understand your feelings,
that you don't want to believe,

00:18:05.618 --> 00:18:08.621
but the Black Tiger is a person of truth!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:16.195
No matter who I may be, I vow by this mask,
that I tell no untruths.

00:18:16.696 --> 00:18:18.698
Please believe me, Orphen.

00:18:22.568 --> 00:18:23.769
Orphen...

00:18:33.779 --> 00:18:37.583
Childman, if you disappeared from this world,

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:40.653
there would be no one who knows I am Azalie.

00:18:41.087 --> 00:18:43.489
It's a shame, but I would have you die.

00:18:43.489 --> 00:18:45.358
O Daggered Thunder!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:59.205
Bloody August is...

00:19:01.107 --> 00:19:02.108
Childman!

00:19:02.108 --> 00:19:03.009
Master!

00:19:03.209 --> 00:19:04.977
O Light of Destruction!

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:13.419
Suffer! Suffer more!

00:19:13.419 --> 00:19:17.089
Like when I was almost killed by you before!

00:19:17.089 --> 00:19:18.758
By my once respected Master!

00:19:19.025 --> 00:19:22.228
That suffering is the suffering I've tasted!

00:19:24.997 --> 00:19:26.265
Why?

00:19:26.265 --> 00:19:28.634
Why doesn't Azalie avoid the attacks?

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:33.472
My beloved student, Azalie,

00:19:34.106 --> 00:19:38.344
if the actions I took on your behalf
are the whole of your anger,

00:19:38.944 --> 00:19:43.315
then I shall embrace your anger in its entirety.

00:19:47.353 --> 00:19:48.587
That is...

00:19:49.622 --> 00:19:50.923
I'm afraid!

00:19:50.923 --> 00:19:53.125
What are you doing, you?!

00:19:53.125 --> 00:19:56.529
If you don't stop right now,
I'll basket-weave you to death at the Olympics!

00:19:58.764 --> 00:20:01.534
Don't go! It's a chance to save Azalie!

00:20:04.737 --> 00:20:07.973
The final stroke! Verdict of Nonexistence!

00:20:12.545 --> 00:20:13.746
That is...

00:20:13.746 --> 00:20:15.514
Magic of total destruction!

00:20:15.514 --> 00:20:19.118
That can't be! Using something like that,
the heart won't be...

00:20:21.921 --> 00:20:23.589
Childman!

00:20:24.156 --> 00:20:25.591
To the other side!

00:20:49.181 --> 00:20:50.683
Why?

00:20:50.683 --> 00:20:53.853
Why did Master use
the magic of total destruction?

00:20:55.287 --> 00:20:56.489
Krylancelo...

00:20:56.489 --> 00:21:00.326
| was just about to believe your horror story,

00:21:01.193 --> 00:21:05.865
but I've seen the real Childman
clearly with my own eyes.

00:21:06.499 --> 00:21:08.934
He has no intention of saving Azalie.

00:21:09.201 --> 00:21:11.537
You're wrong. You're wrong, Krylancelo!

00:21:11.537 --> 00:21:14.373
I'm sure Master has a reason for this!

00:21:14.373 --> 00:21:15.541
Shut up!

00:21:17.476 --> 00:21:20.980
Don't show up in front of me again, Hartia!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.899
Who did that?!

00:21:41.133 --> 00:21:42.468
No matter.

00:21:42.468 --> 00:21:46.005
With this, Bloody August has been
purged from this earth.

00:21:53.679 --> 00:21:59.251
So there is something happening
inside of you after all, Childman.

00:22:16.702 --> 00:22:20.573
Miss Stephanie, why are you
at the Ruins of Baltanders?

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:25.077
The crystals that held the secrets of
the Sword of Baltanders are...

00:22:25.077 --> 00:22:30.416
| won't give up!
| can do anything for Master!

00:22:30.749 --> 00:22:34.019
Whose apprentice do you think I am?

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:36.555
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:36.555 --> 00:22:38.324
RAINBOW COLORED SECRET
"Rainbow Colored Secret."

00:22:38.324 --> 00:22:40.526
RAINBOW COLORED SECRET
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:40.526 --> 00:22:41.527
RAINBOW COLORED SECRET

00:22:43.028 --> 00:22:44.563
What should I do?

00:22:44.563 --> 00:22:46.966
I need you to come after me

00:22:46.966 --> 00:22:51.203
Even if I just kept on walking

00:22:52.771 --> 00:22:54.340
What should I do?

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:56.775
We wouldn't be able to meet

00:22:56.775 --> 00:23:01.080
Even if we knew each other's cell phone numbers

00:23:01.647 --> 00:23:06.518
Headlights illuminate me

00:23:06.518 --> 00:23:10.823
They're too bright, so I close my eyes

00:23:11.457 --> 00:23:13.859
If I kick my high heels off

00:23:13.859 --> 00:23:16.328
And hold them in both hands

00:23:16.328 --> 00:23:21.400
I could even throw away my pride

00:23:21.567 --> 00:23:30.142
For the first time, I feel like
I might do something really unfair

00:23:31.343 --> 00:23:42.021
I just want to collapse on the street and cry

00:23:42.955 --> 00:23:47.459
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:48.193 --> 00:23:52.398
Because I'm not really so strong

00:23:53.132 --> 00:23:57.202
If you kissed me right now

00:23:58.003 --> 00:24:02.641
I'd cry, what should I do?

00:24:02.942 --> 00:24:08.647
What should I do with this love?
